+# 10. Required deliverables
+
+Create a directory such as `artifacts/c2-final-closure/` and include the following. Use the repository's existing naming conventions if they are clearer, but preserve equivalent content.
+
+1. `C2_FINAL_CLOSURE_REPORT.md` — executive summary, before/after, each issue fixed, files changed, test results, limitations and final C2 decision.
+2. `FINAL_VERIFICATION_SUMMARY.md` — one authoritative table of exact commands, exit codes, environment, source hash, log paths and results.
