+5. `PACKAGING_AND_DATA_SAFETY.md` — archive contents/exclusions, fixture strategy, DB/secret scan results and duplicate-toolkit cleanup.
+6. `SPATIAL_DATA_PROVENANCE.md` — area-by-area feature counts, source and timestamps, validation status, hashes and known limits.
+7. Logs for backend tests, frontend lint, TypeScript, build, spatial validator, API smoke checks, packaging scan, and dependency/import checks.
