+Do not say “everything is complete” based on a successful build alone. Do not call mocked/network-unavailable acquisition a live success. Do not declare C2 closed while a mandatory item is blocked or unverified.
+
+**Begin now with Section 1, inspect the repository, then implement and verify every applicable item.**
